  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> This talent requires you to be running the Downtime rules (<em>Pathfinder Roleplaying Game: Ultimate Campaign</em>) to be taken.</p>\n<p>When a room you own becomes broken, you can repair it for half the normal cost (both gold pieces and capital) rounded up. Additionally, buildings and organizations you have created do not suffer from capital attrition for 1 month of absence, after which it affects them as normal. If your building has a manager, they delay capital attrition to 1 every 1 month (instead of every 14 days).</p>\n<p><strong>Associated Feat:</strong> Superintendent (<em>Quests and Campaigns</em>).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/vocation#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
